NL8fSBTzOeFBDz.jpg\\\",\\\"media_type\\\":\\\"tv\\\",\\\"original_language\\\":\\\"ko\\\",\\\"genre_ids\\\":[10765,35],\\\"popularity\\\":153.0691,\\\"first_air_date\\\":\\\"2025-10-03\\\",\\\"vote_average\\\":7.6,\\\"vote_count\\\":22,\\\"origin_country\\\":[\\\"KR\\\"]},{\\\"adult\\\":false,\\\"backdrop_path\\\":\\\"/t7Q6Z4evj32PIrreppppr2ESN7Z.jpg\\\",\\\"id\\\":242907,\\\"name\\\":\\\"Fate\\\",\\\"original_name\\\":\\\"La suerte\\\",\\\"overview\\\":\\\"Taxi driver David becomes the chauffeur for a famous bullfighter known as El Maestro, who is attempting a comeback after years away from the ring. El Maestro's perspective changes, and he starts seeing David as a good luck charm.\\\",\\\"poster_path\\\":\\\"/uTVhABBMuGUoIy5ttHwUm66lGIs.jpg\\\",\\\"media_type\\\":\\\"tv\\\",\\\"original_language\\\":\\\"es\\\",\\\"genre_ids\\\":[35,18],\\\"popularity\\\":10.104,\\\"first_air_date\\\":\\\"2025-10-08\\\",\\\"vote_average\\\":0,\\\"vote_count\\\":0,\\\"origin_country\\\":[\\\"ES\\\"]},{\\\"adult\\\":false,\\\"backdrop_path\\\":\\\"/bDfboQUb45Cv9MYyVBDZw8M8xSM.jpg\\\",\\\"id\\\":95480,\\\"name\\\":\\\"Slow Horses\\\",\\\"original_name\\\":\\\"Slow Horses\\\",\\\"overview\\\":\\\"Follow a dysfunctional team of MI5 agents—and their obnoxious boss, the notorious Jackson Lamb—as they navigate the espionage world's smoke and mirrors to defend England from sinister forces.\\\",\\\"poster_path\\\":\\\"/5RuZZIouptatjV96BdPmKmRsnGg.jpg\\\",\\\"media_type\\\":\\\"tv\\\",\\\"original_language\\\":\\\"en\\\",\\\"genre_ids\\\":[80,18,35],\\\"popularity\\\":66.7074,\\\"first_air_date\\\":\\\"2022-04-01\\\",\\\"vote_average\\\":8,\\\"vote_count\\\":642,\\\"origin_country\\\":[\\\"GB\\\"]},{\\\"adult\\\":false,\\\"backdrop_path\\\":\\\"/3AXLSxMuqyZt8HyrKKfrcJtkswD.jpg\\\",\\\"id\\\":63926,\\\"name\\\":\\\"One-Punch Man\\\",\\\"original_name\\\":\\\"ワンパンマン\\\",\\\"overview\\\":\\\"Saitama is a hero who only became a hero for fun. After three years of “special” training, though, he's become so strong that he's practically invincible. In fact, he's too strong — even his mightiest opponents are taken out with a single punch, and it turns out that being devastatingly powerful is actually kind of a bore. With his passion for being a hero lost along with his hair, yet still faced with new enemies every day, how much longer can he keep it going?\\\",\\\"poster_path\\\":\\\"/jbYJuxfZMpYDalkiOnBcCv9TaL.jpg\\\",\\\"media_type\\\":\\\"tv\\\",\\\"original_language\\\":\\\"ja\\\",\\\"genre_ids\\\":[16,35,10759,10765],\\\"popularity\\\":79.6059,\\\"first_air_date\\\":\\\"2015-10-05\\\",\\\"vote_average\\\":8.398,\\\"vote_count\\\":3827,\\\"origin_country\\\":[\\\"JP\\\"]},{\\\"adult\\\":false,\\\"backdrop_path\\\":\\\"/KQDy2RJMN2gsPV5RZO1pQdFZAQ.jpg\\\",\\\"id\\\":285070,\\\"name\\\":\\\"Ninja vs. Gokudo\\\",\\\"original_name\\\":\\\"忍者と極道\\\",\\\"overview\\\":\\\"The ninja banish evil from the shadows. The gokudo gather lonely outcasts and commit crimes. The grudge they forged centuries ago is rekindled in the present day. The ninja Shinoha meets Kiwami, a gokudo with the face of a businessman. Unknowing of the other's identity, they bond over anime, but the war between ninja and gokudo intensifies. Who will survive and who will perish, ninja or gokudo?\\\",\\\"poster_path\\\":\\\"/zOokyOcW8KtCTkF6Km6KZKABz83.jpg\\\",\\\"media_type\\\":\\\"tv\\\",\\\"original_language\\\":\\\"ja\\\",\\\"genre_ids\\\":[16,10759],\\\"popularity\\\":7.0719,\\\"first_air_date\\\":\\\"2025-10-08\\\",\\\"vote_average\\\":0,\\\"vote_count\\\":0,\\\"origin_country\\\":[\\\"JP\\\"]},{\\\"adult\\\":false,\\\"backdrop_path\\\":\\\"/vNqDJzm7AR95NpLzDn85dEL84vv.jpg\\\",\\\"id\\\":256920,\\\"name\\\":\\\"Love's Ambition\\\",\\\"original_name\\\":\\\"许我耀眼\\\",\\\"overview\\\":\\\"Renowned anchor Xu Yan and urban elite Shen Haoming appear to be the perfect couple but struggle to fit into each other’s social circles due to their differing backgrounds. When conflict arises, Xu Yan leaves, prompting Shen Haoming to realize his deep love for her and attempt to win her back. On their journey, they face challenges, shed their facades, and rediscover their true selves.\\\",\\\"poster_path\\\":\\\"/iH8J36LMEYdvOlYvbBcYCK0ckpp.jpg\\\",\\\"media_type\\\":\\\"tv\\\",\\\"original_language\\\":\\\"zh\\\",\\\"genre_ids\\\":[18],\\\"popularity\\\":74.1614,\\\"first_air_date\\\":\\\"2025-09-26\\\",\\\"vote_average\\\":8,\\\"vote_count\\\":3,\\\"origin_country\\\":[\\\"CN\\\"]},{\\\"adult\\\":false,\\\"backdrop_path\\\":\\\"/is3ZdGCPEKTW7IyDe0khvE1nc6R.jpg\\\",\\\"id\\\":225634,\\\"name\\\":\\\"Monsters: The Lyle and Erik Menendez Story\\\",\\\"original_name\\\":\\\"Monsters: The Lyle and Erik Menendez Story\\\",\\\"overview\\\":\\\"The story of the Menéndez brothers, who were convicted in 1996 of murdering their parents José and Mary Louise “Kitty” Menéndez.\\\",\\\"poster_path\\\":\\\"/x9YC2rpXHUFMqI1hCekKDm9UE4w.jpg\\\",\\\"media_type\\\":\\\"tv\\\",\\\"original_language\\\":\\\"en\\\",\\\"genre_ids\\\":[18,80],\\\"popularity\\\":36.0406,\\\"first_air_date\\\":\\\"2024-09-19\\\",\\\"vote_average\\\":7.6,\\\"vote_count\\\":408,\\\"origin_country\\\":[\\\"US\\\"]},{\\\"adult\\\":false,\\\"backdrop_path\\\":\\\"/kxR0LaIF27D6RiyeSdTx0LHRmGA.jpg\\\",\\\"id\\\":286404,\\\"name\\\":\\\"The Dark History of the Reincarnated Villainess\\\",\\\"original_name\\\":\\\"転生悪女の黒歴史\\\",\\\"overview\\\":\\\"Konoha Satou has a dark history, written throughout middle school a fantasy adventure of love and magic about the Count's daughter Konoha Magnolia and the knights who love her. But when it looks like that dark history is going to be uncovered by her mother, Konoha panics and dies in a traffic accident. Opening her eyes, she finds that she's been reincarnated into the world of her own dark history as Iana Magnolia, the worst villainess of her own creation.\\\",\\\"poster_path\\\":\\\"/yrAx1DmfnZjTs2NKsljqd60Kg9X.jpg\\\",\\\"media_type\\\":\\\"tv\\\",\\\"original_language\\\":\\\"ja\\\",\\\"genre_ids\\\":[16,35],\\\"popularity\\\":4.4542,\\\"first_air_date\\\":\\\"2025-10-09\\\",\\\"vote_average\\\":0,\\\"vote_count\\\":0,\\\"origin_country\\\":[\\\"JP\\\"]},{\\\"adult\\\":false,\\\"backdrop_path\\\":\\\"/mTk3v7maatf4CcMSDZ6x0qBvZa1.jpg\\\",\\\"id\\\":262259,\\\"name\\\":\\\"Wandance\\\",\\\"original_name\\\":\\\"ワンダンス\\\",\\\"overview\\\":\\\"Kaboku has always just gone with the flow, marching in step to the drumbeat of the expectations of those around him: parents, school, plans for the future. It feels predictable, safe, and… empty. But one night, Kaboku's at school late, and he happens on a girl alone, moving wildly, turning a blank space of concrete into a canvas. This is Hikari Wanda, a member of the hip-hop dance club. Kaboku is immediately smitten, but the road to stepping out of his shell is a long one. The club is almost entirely girls, and they're all, well, way better than him. What's ahead is unknown, and that's terrifying, but it also means, for the first time in Kaboku's life… a taste of freedom.\\\",\\\"poster_path\\\":\\\"/1FbU0jXGPTKKWtRkVD1zplH73La.jpg\\\",\\\"media_type\\\":\\\"tv\\\",\\\"original_language\\\":\\\"ja\\\",\\\"genre_ids\\\":[16,18],\\\"popularity\\\":4.1792,\\\"first_air_date\\\":\\\"2025-10-08\\\",\\\"vote_average\\\":0,\\\"vote_count\\\":0,\\\"origin_country\\\":[\\\"JP\\\"]},{\\\"adult\\\":false,\\\"backdrop_path\\\":\\\"/krZyxxsbjqWYuNFAQsGaq9KLA9g.jpg\\\",\\\"id\\\":262928,\\\"name\\\":\\\"Love in the Clouds\\\",\\\"original_name\\\":\\\"入青云\\\",\\\"overview\\\":\\\"At the annual Qingyun Conference in the Hexu Six Realms, Ji Bozai, a warrior from the Jixing Abyss with a past as a convict, defeated Ming Yi, the cold warrior goddess who had reigned supreme for seven consecutive years. Overnight, Ji Bozai became the hottest new star in Jixing Abyss. Meanwhile, Ming Yi, hiding her true identity, disguised herself as a dancer to get close to Ji Bozai. Under their carefully crafted personas, the two engaged in a thrilling dance of deception and attraction, fighting for justice and fairness, and ultimately found a deep and moving love.\\\",\\\"poster_path\\\":\\\"/alXAb26apN2tbRM91QjeZ0KzHlj.jpg\\\",\\\"media_type\\\":\\\"tv\\\",\\\"original_language\\\":\\\"zh\\\",\\\"genre_ids\\\":[18,10765],\\\"popularity\\\":13.2557,\\\"first_air_date\\\":\\\"2025-10-08\\\",\\\"vote_average\\\":0,\\\"vote_count\\\":0,\\\"origin_country\\\":[\\\"CN\\\"]},{\\\"adult\\\":false,\\\"backdrop_path\\\":\\\"/bKxiLRPVWe2nZXCzt6JPr5HNWYm.jpg\\\",\\\"id\\\":110316,\\\"name\\\":\\\"Alice in Borderland\\\",\\\"original_name\\\":\\\"今際の国のアリス\\\",\\\"overview\\\":\\\"With his two friends, a video-game-obsessed young man finds himself in a strange version of Tokyo where they must compete in dangerous games to win.\\\",\\\"poster_path\\\":\\\"/Ac8ruycRXzgcsndTZFK6ouGA0FA.jpg\\\",\\\"media_type\\\":\\\"tv\\\",\\\"original_language\\\":\\\"ja\\\",\\\"genre_ids\\\":[9648,18,10759],\\\"popularity\\\":202.4029,\\\"first_air_date\\\":\\\"2020-12-10\\\",\\\"vote_average\\\":8.154,\\\"vote_count\\\":2429,\\\"origin_country\\\":[\\\"JP\\\"]},{\\\"adult\\\":false,\\\"backdrop_path\\\":\\\"/tsRy63Mu5cu8etL1X7ZLyf7UP1M.jpg\\\",\\\"id\\\":1396,\\\"name\\\":\\\"Breaking Bad\\\",\\\"original_name\\\":\\\"Breaking Bad\\\",\\\"overview\\\":\\\"Walter White, a New Mexico chemistry teacher, is diagnosed with Stage III cancer and given a prognosis of only two years left to live. He becomes filled with a sense of fearlessness and an unrelenting desire to secure his family's financial future at any cost as he enters the dangerous world of drugs and crime.\\\",\\\"poster_path\\\":\\\"/ztkUQFLlC19CCMYHW9o1zWhJRNq.jpg\\\",\\\"media_type\\\":\\\"tv\\\",\\\"original_language\\\":\\\"en\\\",\\\"genre_ids\\\":[18,80],\\\"popularity\\\":94.7305,\\\"first_air_date\\\":\\\"2008-01-20\\\",\\\"vote_average\\\":8.922,\\\"vote_count\\\":16201,\\\"origin_country\\\":[\\\"US\\\"]}],\\\"visible\\\":true},{\\\"title\\\":\\\"Trending Movies\\\",\\\"shows\\\":[{\\\"adult\\\":false,\\\"backdrop_path\\\":\\\"/uxRCrEMJlfCILQhkcDuDpadkQC9.jpg\\\",\\\"id\\\":1352755,\\\"title\\\":\\\"Maintenance Required\\\",\\\"original_title\\\":\\\"Maintenance Required\\\",\\\"overview\\\":\\\"Charlie, the fiercely independent owner of an all-female mechanic shop, is forced to reevaluate her future when a flashy corporate competitor moves in across the street. Seeking comfort, she turns to an anonymous online confidant - unaware she's confiding in Beau, the very rival threatening her business. As sparks fly both online and off, the truth threatens to blow everything apart.\\\",\\\"poster_path\\\":\\\"/lM7Q1y0pmHPWZCPmGkAWGKdgu6W.jpg\\\",\\\"media_type\\\":\\\"movie\\\",\\\"original_language\\\":\\\"en\\\",\\\"genre_ids\\\":[10749,35],\\\"popularity\\\":44.9168,\\\"release_date\\\":\\\"2025-10-07\\\",\\\"video\\\":false,\\\"vote_average\\\":6.273,\\\"vote_count\\\":11},{\\\"adult\\\":false,\\\"backdrop_path\\\":\\\"/9DYFYhmbXRGsMhfUgXM3VSP9uLX.jpg\\\",\\\"id\\\":1038392,\\\"title\\\":\\\"The Conjuring: Last Rites\\\",\\\"original_title\\\":\\\"The Conjuring: Last Rites\\\",\\\"overview\\\":\\\"Paranormal investigators Ed and Lorraine Warren take on one last terrifying case involving mysterious entities they must confront.\\\",\\\"poster_path\\\":\\\"/7JzOmJ1fIU43I3gLHYsY8UzNzjG.jpg\\\",\\\"media_type\\\":\\\"movie\\\",\\\"original_language\\\":\\\"en\\\",\\\"genre_ids\\\":[27,53,9648],\\\"popularity\\\":590.5591,\\\"release_date\\\":\\\"2025-09-03\\\",\\\"video\\\":false,\\\"vote_average\\\":6.934,\\\"vote_count\\\":682},{\\\"adult\\\":false,\\\"backdrop_path\\\":\\\"/np0dsehLDdbfyHFRtqCiL1GR0TQ.jpg\\\",\\\"id\\\":533533,\\\"title\\\":\\\"TRON: Ares\\\",\\\"original_title\\\":\\\"TRON: Ares\\\",\\\"overview\\\":\\\"A highly sophisticated Program called Ares is sent from the digital world into the real world on a dangerous mission, marking humankind's first encounter with A.I. beings.\\\",\\\"poster_path\\\":\\\"/chpWmskl3a